1
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:55,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The 7th National Expenditure Program of the Department of Health and its attached agencies is hereby called to order.

2
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:58,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I would like to acknowledge the presence of senators who are present with us today.

3
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:06,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I would like to acknowledge Senator Panfilo Lacson and, of course, Senator Raffy Tulfo.

4
00:11:06,300 --> 00:11:09,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, sir, for joining us this morning.

5
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:16,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At this juncture, let me direct the Committee Secretary to acknowledge the resource persons present for today.

6
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:22,080
Committee Secretary: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Good morning. Good morning to Senators Laxon and Rafi Tulfo.

7
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:30,980
Committee Secretary: For the briefing on the proposed FY2027 budget of the Department of Health and attached agencies and corporations, namely the National Nutrition Council,

8
00:11:31,540 --> 00:11:39,760
Committee Secretary: Philippine National AIDS Council, Long Center of the Philippines, National Kidney and Transplant Institute, Philippine Children's Medical Center,

9
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:47,020
Committee Secretary: Philippine Health Insurance Corporation, Philippine Heart Center, and the Philippine Institute of Traditional and Alternative Healthcare,

10
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:49,300
Committee Secretary: we would like to acknowledge our resource persons.

11
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:56,600
Committee Secretary: From the DOH, we have Secretary Edwin Mercado, Undersecretary Elmer Punzalan, Undersecretary Gloria Balboa,

12
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:01,740
Committee Secretary: Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo Maestral, Undersecretary Albert Francis Domingo,

13
00:12:02,140 --> 00:12:07,340
Committee Secretary: Undersecretary Brigida Romualdez Aquino, Undersecretary Christian Leal Sakilabon,

14
00:12:07,340 --> 00:12:16,520
Committee Secretary: OIC Undersecretary Maylyn Beltran, OIC ASEC Lester Tan, OIC ASEC Kerna Manatad, OIC ASEC Rizal Nikahau,

15
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:23,440
Committee Secretary: OIC ASEC Melissa Sena, and OIC Director General of FDA, Attorney Franklin Anthony Tabaking IV.

16
00:12:23,900 --> 00:12:27,940
Committee Secretary: For the Philippine National AIDS Council, we have Executive Director Joselito Feliciano.

17
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:33,060
Committee Secretary: For the Long Center of the Philippines, we have Executive Director Dr. Joubert Benedicto.

18
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:38,040
Committee Secretary: From the National Kidney and Transplant Institute, we have the Executive Director Dr. Jose Dante Dator.

19
00:12:38,260 --> 00:12:42,540
Committee Secretary: From the PCMC, we have the Medical Center Chief Dr. Cecilia Gant.

20
00:12:42,540 --> 00:12:47,100
Committee Secretary: From the Philippine Health Insurance Corporation or Field Health, we have PCEO Beverly,

21
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:56,460
Committee Secretary: Lorraine Ho, Senior VP Renato Limshako Jr., Acting Senior VP Carlo Irwin-Panelo, and VP Joseph Anthony Lachica.

22
00:12:56,780 --> 00:13:00,480
Committee Secretary: From the Philippine Heart Center, we have Dr. Avenilo Aventura Jr.

23
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:07,580
Committee Secretary: From the Philippine Institute of Traditional and Alternative Healthcare or PTAC, we have Dr. Maria Teresa Inigo, the Director General.

24
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:11,160
Committee Secretary: We have also invited representatives from the DBM and COA.

25
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:16,160
Committee Secretary: For DBM, we're still waiting for Director Benjelad Zuniga, OIC Director May...

26
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:21,060
Committee Secretary: ...Piniega, Director Elena, and Director Elena Regina Brillantes.

27
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:30,160
Committee Secretary: From COA, we already have Mr. Frederick Manalo, Ms. Mary Jane Sadang, Ms. Rhea Magsino-Montenegro, and Attorney May Ann Sarmiento.

28
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,120
Committee Secretary: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

29
00:13:32,100 --> 00:13:32,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you.

30
00:13:34,940 --> 00:13:41,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Good morning. The Chair would like to first give his opening statement, then I would ask my colleagues also.

31
00:13:42,860 --> 00:13:43,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Magandang umaga po sa ating lahat.

32
00:13:44,500 --> 00:13:47,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Today, we take up the proposed 2027 budget.

33
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:50,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Of the Department of Health and its attached agencies and corporations.

34
00:13:50,940 --> 00:13:56,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Health is one of the clearest tests of whether a national budget is working for the ordinary Filipinos.

35
00:13:56,560 --> 00:14:03,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ramdam agad ito kapag pumunta sila sa health center, pampublikong ospital, pharmacy, or PhilHealth accredited facility.

36
00:14:04,660 --> 00:14:07,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I have never denied my bias towards healthcare.

37
00:14:08,140 --> 00:14:15,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As author and principal sponsor of the Universal Healthcare Act, I want UHC to succeed and fulfill its promises.

38
00:14:15,820 --> 00:14:17,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But it can only do so...

39
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:20,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: If it is sufficiently funded and properly implemented.

40
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:30,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In a sheer twist of fate, this humble representation became the Chair of the Senate Committee on Finance and will defend the budget of the Department of Health.

41
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:36,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I was fortunate enough to have worked with the Secretary of Health when he was field head president.

42
00:14:37,140 --> 00:14:42,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And the one who took over his role was instrumental in drafting the UHC.

43
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:47,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dr. Beverly Ho was one of the assistants.

44
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:53,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The secretaries of the UH when we were drafting and deliberating on the universal healthcare.

45
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:59,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Of course, I would like also to acknowledge Usec Albert Domingo, who was then with...

46
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:07,660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: who was also with us as we were passing the universal health care.

47
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:15,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That's why I can say it's like a dream team for UHC to have Dr. Ed Mercado as secretary

48
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:26,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: who really has improved the operations of field health and implementation of UHC under his administration.

49
00:15:26,820 --> 00:15:39,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, I'm very happy to have Secretary Mercado, Dr. Bevo, Yuseg Domingo, and the rest of the officials of the DOH

50
00:15:39,300 --> 00:15:42,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: who are really pro-universal health care.

51
00:15:43,340 --> 00:15:46,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ngayon tayo na ang chair ng Senate Committee on Finance.

52
00:15:46,860 --> 00:15:52,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Malinaw na ang nais nating makita sa budget na ito, hindi lamang mas malaking pondo,

53
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:55,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kundi ang mas accessible na serbisyong pangkalusugan

54
00:15:55,700 --> 00:15:56,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at mas mababang medical out-of-pocket expense.

55
00:15:56,820 --> 00:16:04,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The UHC Act requires us to shift toward primary and preventive care

56
00:16:04,520 --> 00:16:08,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: rather than relying predominantly on hospital-based treatment.

57
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:13,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya kailangan nating palakasin ang primary health care sa ating mga komunidad,

58
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:17,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kasabay ang pagpapaayos ng ating mga provincial hospitals,

59
00:16:18,620 --> 00:16:22,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: medical equipment at health workforce.

60
00:16:22,340 --> 00:16:26,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ngayon po ay napaganda natin through the years

61
00:16:26,220 --> 00:16:33,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: itong mga apex hospitals o mga DOH-run hospitals dahil sa budget na rin ng specialty centers

62
00:16:33,100 --> 00:16:34,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na inilagay ng Senado.

63
00:16:35,180 --> 00:16:39,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Gusto rin nating makita ang mas malakas na PhilHealth,

64
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:44,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: a PhilHealth which can give benefit packages that reflect the actual health needs of Filipinos.

65
00:16:45,300 --> 00:16:51,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Gusto rin nating matiyak ang pagpapataas pa ng PhilHealth participation sa mga hospital bills,

66
00:16:51,060 --> 00:16:54,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: upang mapababa ang out-of-pocket expense ng bawat pasyente.

67
00:16:56,220 --> 00:17:00,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nagpahayag po tayo na ngayong 2027,

68
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:04,660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: gusto natin mabigyang prayoridad ang health care ng bawat Pilipino.

69
00:17:04,660 --> 00:17:07,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Iyon po ang ating ipaglalaban.

70
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:12,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang malusog na mamamayan ay isang mamamayan na makapag-aambag sa pag-unlad ng bayan.

71
00:17:12,820 --> 00:17:17,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Universal health care was enacted so that every Filipino can receive health services

72
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:20,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: they need without financial hardship.

73
00:17:20,980 --> 00:17:26,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Our task today is to determine whether the proposed 2027 budget,

74
00:17:26,060 --> 00:17:28,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: truly brings us closer to that promise,

75
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:33,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: not only on paper, but in the patient's actual experience.

76
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:37,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So I hope that the department and its attached agencies can give us clear targets,

77
00:17:37,900 --> 00:17:40,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: clear timelines, and clear accountability.

78
00:17:40,820 --> 00:17:44,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: By the end of this hearing, we should know what a Filipino patient

79
00:17:44,020 --> 00:17:46,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: should concretely expect from this budget,

80
00:17:46,780 --> 00:17:50,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: how much less he or she should have to pay out of pocket,

81
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:55,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and which programs Congress must strengthen to make those results possible.

82
00:17:56,060 --> 00:18:04,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We assure that, this budget hearing, sabi ko nga po, bias po ako, but we will give health care programs

83
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:06,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: utmost priority.

84
00:18:06,340 --> 00:18:08,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At ito po yung talagang ramdam ng taong bayan,

85
00:18:08,540 --> 00:18:10,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na kahit ano pang problema,

86
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ano pang mga hamon,

87
00:18:12,300 --> 00:18:15,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: whatever challenges that our country is facing,

88
00:18:15,580 --> 00:18:18,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: as long as our countrymen,

89
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: as long as the Filipinos,

90
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:24,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: hangga't ramdam po nila na andiyan po ang gobyerno para umalalay po sa

91
00:18:24,140 --> 00:18:25,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kanilang oras sa pangangailangan,

92
00:18:25,740 --> 00:18:29,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: lalo na sa pagkakasakit, ay malaking bagay po yun.

93
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:31,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya maraming maraming salamat po.

94
00:18:32,220 --> 00:18:37,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'm looking forward to a very productive hearing.

95
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:40,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So I'd like to ask our colleagues,

96
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:43,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Panfilo Lacson first to give his statement.

97
00:18:44,980 --> 00:18:46,720
Senator Panfilo Lacson: None from this representation, Mr. Chairman.

98
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:48,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Tulfo.

99
00:18:50,970 --> 00:18:52,390
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

100
00:18:52,390 --> 00:19:01,210
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Since I became Senator at tuwing magkakaroon ng budget hearing sa Department of Health,

101
00:19:01,810 --> 00:19:07,370
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: lagi ko pong kini-kwestiyon bakit walang palya

102
00:19:07,370 --> 00:19:11,830
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: nagkakaroon ng mga gamot na nag-expire.

103
00:19:12,950 --> 00:19:18,570
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Not only by the hundreds of millions, but by the billions B, billions of pesos.

104
00:19:19,570 --> 00:19:21,250
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ba't nangyayari ito?

105
00:19:21,250 --> 00:19:26,950
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Samantalang maraming mga health centers tayo na sumisigaw na kulang sila sa gamot.

106
00:19:27,830 --> 00:19:32,150
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Maraming mga may hirap natin kababayan ng kakamatay na dahil hindi nakakarating sa kanila

107
00:19:32,150 --> 00:19:34,530
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: yung mga gamot na they deserve.

108
00:19:35,950 --> 00:19:38,590
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At ang palaging sinasabi ng DOH,

109
00:19:40,290 --> 00:19:45,130
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ito raw ay nagkakaroon sila ng konting oversight, ang reason.

110
00:19:46,310 --> 00:19:47,330
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And then number two,

111
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:50,190
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: yung gamot daw na nag-expire,

112
00:19:50,190 --> 00:19:52,050
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: sinusoli naman daw sa mga supplier.

113
00:19:53,270 --> 00:19:55,470
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At yung mga supplier, pinapalitan.

114
00:19:57,070 --> 00:19:58,130
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Gigibaing ko yung,

115
00:19:58,470 --> 00:19:59,710
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ngayong araw na ito, right now,

116
00:20:00,890 --> 00:20:03,350
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: yung kasinungalingan ng DOH for so many years

117
00:20:03,350 --> 00:20:05,030
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na binubudol, ini-scam

118
00:20:05,030 --> 00:20:08,330
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ang taongbaya na sinasabing isinusoli

119
00:20:08,330 --> 00:20:10,490
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ang mga gamot na nag-expire.

120
00:20:11,150 --> 00:20:13,990
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: May ebidensya ako na yung mga gamot na yun ay binabaon.

121
00:20:14,950 --> 00:20:17,130
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I have pictures here that will show

122
00:20:17,130 --> 00:20:19,570
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: yung mga medicines na yan,

123
00:20:20,190 --> 00:20:21,190
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: binabaon.

124
00:20:22,930 --> 00:20:23,970
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat may managot dyan,

125
00:20:24,090 --> 00:20:26,630
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: dapat may makulong sa kasinungalingan.

126
00:20:30,310 --> 00:20:32,330
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pangalawa, sa FDA,

127
00:20:33,710 --> 00:20:35,870
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: i-reserve ko na muna ang katanungan ko later on

128
00:20:35,870 --> 00:20:36,950
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: tungkol sa mga anomalyang.

129
00:20:37,050 --> 00:20:38,570
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Napakaraming anomalyang ang DOH.

130
00:20:39,450 --> 00:20:41,390
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Secretary Mercado, walang kinalaman dito.

131
00:20:42,510 --> 00:20:43,310
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yung anomalyang,

132
00:20:43,870 --> 00:20:45,690
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: talamak nung panahon ni Herbosa.

133
00:20:46,450 --> 00:20:47,870
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And I have proof to show that.

134
00:20:48,290 --> 00:20:49,330
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At marami siyang mga alipores.

135
00:20:49,470 --> 00:20:50,790
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Isang alipores niya hanggang ngayon,

136
00:20:51,110 --> 00:20:51,830
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: nasa DOH pa.

137
00:20:51,910 --> 00:20:52,610
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yung iba, wala na.

138
00:20:53,070 --> 00:20:54,470
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: FDA.

139
00:20:57,230 --> 00:20:59,010
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nawala na nga itong si Teston.

140
00:21:00,010 --> 00:21:00,730
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Praise the Lord.

141
00:21:01,490 --> 00:21:03,130
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero ang pumalit naman,

142
00:21:03,330 --> 00:21:04,210
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: alipores niya,

143
00:21:05,110 --> 00:21:06,150
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na siya ang nagbit-bit

144
00:21:06,150 --> 00:21:08,510
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: sa FDA.

145
00:21:09,250 --> 00:21:11,490
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: By the person of Franklin Tabakin.

146
00:21:11,910 --> 00:21:12,630
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Where is Tabakin?

147
00:21:13,470 --> 00:21:14,950
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: May kaso ka sa ombudsman, di po ba?

148
00:21:16,430 --> 00:21:17,990
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Bakit ikaw, huwag ka na magsumagot.

149
00:21:18,110 --> 00:21:19,570
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Bakit ikaw ang na-appoint?

150
00:21:20,270 --> 00:21:21,570
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Samantalang marami naman dyan,

151
00:21:21,690 --> 00:21:23,470
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: mas qualified pa sa iyo sa FDA.

152
00:21:23,470 --> 00:21:23,630
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay?

153
00:21:24,990 --> 00:21:25,930
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: For so many years.

154
00:21:26,670 --> 00:21:28,150
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At alam nila ins and outs ng FDA.

155
00:21:28,370 --> 00:21:29,450
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And yet, ikaw ang in-appoint.

156
00:21:29,870 --> 00:21:30,130
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mali.

157
00:21:31,630 --> 00:21:32,790
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nagkamali ang malakanyang.

158
00:21:33,410 --> 00:21:35,370
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi binit-bit ka ni Teston.

159
00:21:36,250 --> 00:21:38,130
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kung saang impyerno ka nang galing,

160
00:21:38,470 --> 00:21:39,630
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: binit-bit ka ni Teston eh.

161
00:21:39,850 --> 00:21:41,070
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang dami mong nilampasan,

162
00:21:41,190 --> 00:21:42,290
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ang dami mong nilundagan,

163
00:21:42,410 --> 00:21:43,510
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: dahil ang lakas mo kay Teston.

164
00:21:45,110 --> 00:21:46,430
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Naging deputy general ka

165
00:21:46,430 --> 00:21:48,230
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: from director for,

166
00:21:48,510 --> 00:21:50,270
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: lumundag ka ng ilang beses.

167
00:21:51,130 --> 00:21:52,070
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dahil nga kay Teston,

168
00:21:52,170 --> 00:21:52,830
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: itong walang hiyan to.

169
00:21:54,310 --> 00:21:54,830
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ngayon,

170
00:21:54,830 --> 00:21:59,330
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ikaw yung OIC.

171
00:21:59,590 --> 00:22:00,710
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At meron akong balita

172
00:22:00,710 --> 00:22:03,530
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na ikaw raw ang gagawing director general.

