Senator Panfilo Lacson: Mr. Chairman, with the indulgence of, with the permission of Sen. Tulfo, can we go back further in time, ano?

1134
01:06:04,950 --> 01:06:14,630
Senator Panfilo Lacson: 2024, 2023, 2022, kung meron kayong datas, magkano pa yung yearly na nag-expire na tinatapo natin?

1135
01:06:15,150 --> 01:06:17,210
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Para na ma-appreciate namin better.

1136
01:06:22,280 --> 01:06:24,880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Eto, Senping, Senping, I have this.

1137
01:06:25,560 --> 01:06:31,260
Senator Panfilo Lacson: For the record, ma'am.

1138
01:06:31,780 --> 01:06:33,540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sige, mas maganda, magaling po sa inyo.

1139
01:06:35,120 --> 01:06:37,440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sige, kunin nyo lang, pagpapawisang kayo.

1140
01:06:37,440 --> 01:06:51,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, just ano, with the indulgence of Sen. Turtulpo, itong ano na talagang year-in, year-out talagang problema, itong procurement, yung mga expiring medicines, sayang din, ilang dang milyon.

1141
01:06:51,940 --> 01:06:55,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, if we can deduce away a system, na sinasabing yung Sen. Turtulpo.

1142
01:06:56,120 --> 01:07:06,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Meron po kasi, alam sa amin, may mga local LGUs that now have, meron silang entity.

1143
01:07:07,440 --> 01:07:11,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Na prescription-based. Pero mahirap kasi sa DOH yun.

1144
01:07:11,260 --> 01:07:17,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi meron tayong, ano, yung mga health centers.

1145
01:07:17,420 --> 01:07:23,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero sa kanila, hindi sila bumibili na ng maramihan, ng volume.

1146
01:07:23,960 --> 01:07:27,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because kung ano lang yung na-prescribe, that's the only medicines they pay.

1147
01:07:28,060 --> 01:07:32,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So probably that's one option dun po sa mga local and provincial.

1148
01:07:32,440 --> 01:07:35,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But I don't know with DOH kung paano po pwedeng gawing sistema.

1149
01:07:35,620 --> 01:07:37,360
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tata mo.

1150
01:07:37,440 --> 01:07:42,600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, Sen. JB, Mr. Chair, hindi ko makalimutan yun.

1151
01:07:42,700 --> 01:07:46,640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I went to an island somewhere in Bohol a few years ago.

1152
01:07:47,400 --> 01:07:50,340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And nilapitan ako ng barangay chairwoman nila.

1153
01:07:50,940 --> 01:07:53,380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At sinasabi niya, wala rin nakakarating na gamot sa kanila.

1154
01:07:54,540 --> 01:07:55,560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Napakinggan yung hearing.

1155
01:07:56,080 --> 01:08:02,260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sir, nagulat kami nung mapakinggan namin na daan-daan milyon ang nage-expire na gamot.

1156
01:08:02,360 --> 01:08:04,200
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Samantalang sa amin, wala po nakakarating.

1157
01:08:04,200 --> 01:08:06,680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Paano kayo nag-procure ng gamot?

1158
01:08:07,440 --> 01:08:08,940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Contribute po kami. Kami-kami.

1159
01:08:09,140 --> 01:08:09,900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nag-aambag-ambag.

1160
01:08:10,020 --> 01:08:11,740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi walang dumarating sa health center namin.

1161
01:08:11,900 --> 01:08:14,660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kung meron man, kunti-kunti.

1162
01:08:14,820 --> 01:08:15,760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And about to expire.

1163
01:08:16,160 --> 01:08:17,180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Di po ba nakakaya yun?

1164
01:08:17,240 --> 01:08:20,120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Not only that yung Prambola, kundi sa iba-iba pang mga health centers,

1165
01:08:20,220 --> 01:08:23,860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: barangay health centers nationwide, na kulang sa gamot.

1166
01:08:25,060 --> 01:08:27,560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kulang sa, especially sa mga maintenance na gamot.

1167
01:08:28,560 --> 01:08:31,040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Maski na mga simple lang na mga paracetamol.

1168
01:08:31,500 --> 01:08:31,860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala.

1169
01:08:33,360 --> 01:08:33,900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Di ba?

1170
01:08:34,160 --> 01:08:35,060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And yet,

1171
01:08:36,320 --> 01:08:37,420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: every single year,

1172
01:08:37,440 --> 01:08:38,540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: by the hundreds of millions,

1173
01:08:38,620 --> 01:08:39,660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: meron pa nga billions eh.

1174
01:08:40,580 --> 01:08:41,100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Billion.

1175
01:08:42,380 --> 01:08:43,220
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 11, oh see?

1176
01:08:43,620 --> 01:08:45,620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 11 billion pesos

1177
01:08:45,620 --> 01:08:46,880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ibinaon sa lupa.

1178
01:08:48,240 --> 01:08:48,840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 2023,

1179
01:08:49,080 --> 01:08:50,600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: pang magkita ng expired na gamot.

1180
01:08:50,940 --> 01:08:51,940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat dyan may makulong.

1181
01:08:52,040 --> 01:08:53,480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat dyan may mapugutan ng ulo eh.

1182
01:08:55,160 --> 01:08:57,280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Napaka-skandaloso yung amount na yan.

1183
01:08:57,740 --> 01:08:58,120
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yes po.

1184
01:08:58,880 --> 01:09:00,540
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Mr. Chair, if I may po.

1185
01:09:01,380 --> 01:09:02,100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang mga,

1186
01:09:02,860 --> 01:09:05,060
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: before I go to the expired meds nga po,

1187
01:09:05,120 --> 01:09:06,020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: may datos na kami.

1188
01:09:06,020 --> 01:09:07,380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero ang una po namin,

1189
01:09:07,440 --> 01:09:08,440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung pinag-aaralan,

1190
01:09:08,440 --> 01:09:11,240
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay parang yung nabanggit ni Sen. JV.

1191
01:09:11,620 --> 01:09:12,880
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Talagang palakasin yung gamot

1192
01:09:12,880 --> 01:09:14,460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para doon napadaanin.

1193
01:09:14,460 --> 01:09:17,220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At yung nakalaang budget

1194
01:09:17,220 --> 01:09:19,320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para dito sa commodities,

1195
01:09:19,320 --> 01:09:20,720
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: maibigay na lang sa PhilHealth

1196
01:09:20,720 --> 01:09:22,520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para sila yung nagpa-purchase.

1197
01:09:22,520 --> 01:09:23,220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi at least,

1198
01:09:23,580 --> 01:09:24,460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: broad dyan.

1199
01:09:24,460 --> 01:09:28,360
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At saka ang mga pharmacist na engaged namin ay nandun.

1200
01:09:28,360 --> 01:09:30,060
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At negotiated naman po yung price.

1201
01:09:30,060 --> 01:09:30,820
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, isa po yun.

1202
01:09:31,320 --> 01:09:31,900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pangalwa po,

1203
01:09:31,900 --> 01:09:33,600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung aming procurement nga yan,

1204
01:09:33,600 --> 01:09:35,000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na decentralized na po,

1205
01:09:35,500 --> 01:09:37,280
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 40% na lang po yung pinoprocure sa iyo.

1206
01:09:37,280 --> 01:09:37,920
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Or centrally,

1207
01:09:37,920 --> 01:09:38,780
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung 60%,

1208
01:09:38,780 --> 01:09:41,320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: lalo na po yung mga common essential meds

1209
01:09:41,320 --> 01:09:43,220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na meron naman locally available,

1210
01:09:43,220 --> 01:09:45,920
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay doon na po sa CHD ginagamit

1211
01:09:45,920 --> 01:09:47,420
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: or pinoprocure.

1212
01:09:47,420 --> 01:09:50,300
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pangatlo po nga yung pagtingin ko ulit po

1213
01:09:50,300 --> 01:09:51,720
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: doon sa IT system.

1214
01:09:51,720 --> 01:09:55,500
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: But nabanggit nga po ni Sen. Tulfo,

1215
01:09:55,500 --> 01:09:57,260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at siguro po maki-create po talaga ako

1216
01:09:57,260 --> 01:09:59,640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ng investigating committee 2G3.

1217
01:09:59,640 --> 01:10:00,700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, isa meron na eh.

1218
01:10:00,700 --> 01:10:02,700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Inter-office task force,

1219
01:10:02,700 --> 01:10:03,700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I believe.

1220
01:10:03,700 --> 01:10:08,140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Eh, kayo po ay isa sa mga member nito.

1221
01:10:08,140 --> 01:10:10,740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yusek Balboa.

1222
01:10:10,740 --> 01:10:13,040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Masama si Yusek Balboa?

1223
01:10:13,040 --> 01:10:13,540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay.

1224
01:10:13,540 --> 01:10:15,240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, ano pong resulta

1225
01:10:15,240 --> 01:10:17,840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: nung inyong ginawang investigation?

1226
01:10:17,840 --> 01:10:21,560
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Ay hindi po kami yung nag-imbestiga.

1227
01:10:21,560 --> 01:10:23,760
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: Kami po yung weekly po na nag-meet

1228
01:10:23,760 --> 01:10:25,880
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: para po i-discuss yung mga issues

1229
01:10:25,880 --> 01:10:28,100
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: concerning doon sa policy

1230
01:10:28,100 --> 01:10:29,800
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: at saka doon sa procurement

1231
01:10:29,800 --> 01:10:31,160
DOH Undersecretary Dr. Gloria J. Balboa: at saka supply chain po.

1232
01:10:31,160 --> 01:10:32,820
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: But anyway, ito na lang po ano,

1233
01:10:32,820 --> 01:10:34,780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: isek merkado.

1234
01:10:35,920 --> 01:10:37,260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Gawa na kayo ng sistema.

1235
01:10:37,420 --> 01:10:38,420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sana ma-perfect nyo na.

1236
01:10:38,540 --> 01:10:39,860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nawala na mag-expire na gamot.

1237
01:10:39,940 --> 01:10:40,840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kung meron man mag-expire,

1238
01:10:40,920 --> 01:10:41,520
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: hindi maiwasan.

1239
01:10:41,820 --> 01:10:43,080
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Huwag naman daan milyon.

1240
01:10:43,500 --> 01:10:44,580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Isang milyon, dalawang milyon,

1241
01:10:44,660 --> 01:10:45,640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: acceptable yun.

1242
01:10:45,820 --> 01:10:46,300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tolerable.

1243
01:10:46,580 --> 01:10:47,960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero kung hundreds of millions

1244
01:10:47,960 --> 01:10:49,500
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at marami mga health centers

1245
01:10:49,500 --> 01:10:51,300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: hindi nakakakuha ng gamot,

1246
01:10:51,880 --> 01:10:53,080
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: nakakaloko naman yun.

1247
01:10:53,980 --> 01:10:55,260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And then dapat may managot.

1248
01:10:55,540 --> 01:10:56,300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: May managot talaga.

1249
01:10:56,500 --> 01:10:56,980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kaya sabi ko,

1250
01:10:57,020 --> 01:10:58,440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: mag-privileged speech ako

1251
01:10:58,440 --> 01:11:00,300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: para ito ay may recommend sa Blue Ribbon

1252
01:11:00,300 --> 01:11:01,300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at ma-investigahan ito.

1253
01:11:01,300 --> 01:11:03,100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ito, malaking anomalya.

1254
01:11:03,200 --> 01:11:04,100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Now, pangalawa pa po,

1255
01:11:04,700 --> 01:11:06,300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mr. Mercado,

1256
01:11:08,260 --> 01:11:12,760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: itong mental health medicines

1257
01:11:12,760 --> 01:11:14,880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na napoprocure ninyo,

1258
01:11:16,260 --> 01:11:17,560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ito yung pinakamalaking share

1259
01:11:17,560 --> 01:11:18,580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ng 2026

1260
01:11:18,580 --> 01:11:21,680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na hindi rin nagagamit,

1261
01:11:21,760 --> 01:11:22,800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: nadidispose of ninyo,

1262
01:11:22,900 --> 01:11:24,920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na dapat ito ay napupunta

1263
01:11:24,920 --> 01:11:27,440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: sa Mandaluyong Mental Health Center.

1264
01:11:29,610 --> 01:11:30,290
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi hindi nyo alam

1265
01:11:30,290 --> 01:11:32,030
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: kung paano i-administer ito.

1266
01:11:32,030 --> 01:11:32,550
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So wala kayong,

1267
01:11:32,610 --> 01:11:33,570
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: kakayahan sa DOH

1268
01:11:33,570 --> 01:11:34,610
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na mag-administer nito.

1269
01:11:35,090 --> 01:11:36,210
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So ito yung nage-expire lang.

1270
01:11:36,770 --> 01:11:38,190
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At meron ako muna babalita

1271
01:11:38,190 --> 01:11:40,770
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na tinatanggal yung expiry date

1272
01:11:40,770 --> 01:11:42,510
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: e binibenta sa labas.

1273
01:11:44,070 --> 01:11:44,990
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nasaan si Machado?

1274
01:11:45,050 --> 01:11:45,590
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Si Machado,

1275
01:11:45,670 --> 01:11:46,390
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: isa pa sa mga

1276
01:11:46,390 --> 01:11:47,990
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: sangkot sa kalukuan eh.

1277
01:11:48,890 --> 01:11:49,050
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ha?

1278
01:11:49,770 --> 01:11:50,710
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: David Machado.

1279
01:11:51,050 --> 01:11:51,570
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Machadong,

1280
01:11:51,630 --> 01:11:53,290
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: masyado na talaga itong taon ito.

1281
01:11:54,070 --> 01:11:54,630
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Masyado.

1282
01:11:57,240 --> 01:11:57,460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Oo.

1283
01:12:00,100 --> 01:12:00,740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yung sa,

1284
01:12:01,420 --> 01:12:02,060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: saka pa pala,

1285
01:12:02,240 --> 01:12:03,020
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: lulundag-lundag ako.

1286
01:12:03,860 --> 01:12:04,260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Alam nyo,

1287
01:12:04,260 --> 01:12:05,440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: nag-donate tayo

1288
01:12:05,440 --> 01:12:07,180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: sa World Health Organization

1289
01:12:07,180 --> 01:12:08,900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ng 10 million dollars

1290
01:12:08,900 --> 01:12:09,740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: worth of medicine.

1291
01:12:09,900 --> 01:12:11,100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang yabang naman natin.

1292
01:12:12,480 --> 01:12:13,440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Samantalang yung Singapore

1293
01:12:13,440 --> 01:12:15,700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: nag-donate 100,000 US,

1294
01:12:16,120 --> 01:12:18,260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 100,000 Singaporean dollars lang.

1295
01:12:19,060 --> 01:12:20,180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tayo 10 million.

1296
01:12:20,340 --> 01:12:20,680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hanggang ngayon,

1297
01:12:20,740 --> 01:12:21,640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: binabayaran natin yun

1298
01:12:21,640 --> 01:12:22,340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: in tranches.

1299
01:12:23,800 --> 01:12:24,140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Why?

1300
01:12:24,720 --> 01:12:25,960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi naman tayo mayamang bansa.

1301
01:12:26,100 --> 01:12:26,680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang yabang natin.

1302
01:12:26,780 --> 01:12:27,140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Bakit?

1303
01:12:27,260 --> 01:12:28,460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi mayabang yung si,

1304
01:12:28,780 --> 01:12:29,000
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: si,

1305
01:12:29,100 --> 01:12:29,160
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: si,

1306
01:12:29,160 --> 01:12:30,520
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: si Herbosa.

1307
01:12:30,660 --> 01:12:31,680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Gusto niya ata maging director

1308
01:12:31,680 --> 01:12:32,420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ng DOH,

1309
01:12:32,420 --> 01:12:34,780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ng World Health Organization.

1310
01:12:34,800 --> 01:12:36,100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Baka pwede nating i-cancel yun?

1311
01:12:36,360 --> 01:12:36,940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pwede pa ba yun?

1312
01:12:39,220 --> 01:12:39,780
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pinag-aaralan po

1313
01:12:39,780 --> 01:12:41,260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at kami po ay sumasangguni

1314
01:12:41,260 --> 01:12:42,620
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: sa DOF

1315
01:12:42,620 --> 01:12:43,700
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at saka po sa DFA.

1316
01:12:44,060 --> 01:12:45,200
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero ang aking nga po

1317
01:12:45,200 --> 01:12:46,640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: direction ay gamitin po muna

1318
01:12:46,640 --> 01:12:48,300
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para doon sa ating local needs.

1319
01:12:48,580 --> 01:12:49,520
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So i-cancel nyo na yun.

1320
01:12:49,560 --> 01:12:50,400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Huwag na yung pag-aaralan.

1321
01:12:50,500 --> 01:12:51,100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Cancel nyo na.

1322
01:12:51,880 --> 01:12:52,480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi naman siguro

1323
01:12:52,480 --> 01:12:53,080
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: tayo makukulong.

1324
01:12:53,700 --> 01:12:54,660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pwede ba tayong kasuan

1325
