06:03:26,250 --> 06:03:26,570
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Inspectors.

7708
06:03:26,570 --> 06:03:34,550
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: For every inspector that goes around, they're required to check the pharmacies, all the establishments.

7709
06:03:34,930 --> 06:03:38,810
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: They're required to go around selling, whether it's pharmaceutical or cosmetics and so on and so forth.

7710
06:03:38,990 --> 06:03:42,110
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: There's not enough for them to even go back in one year.

7711
06:03:42,190 --> 06:03:46,210
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So if you've been visited this year, you should sell contraband because you might not be able to return it.

7712
06:03:46,370 --> 06:03:49,290
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Of course, it's a crime, but that's a problem.

7713
06:03:49,290 --> 06:03:55,690
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And so the issue that we acknowledge was the need for a bigger budget to support this personnel.

7714
06:03:56,370 --> 06:04:03,090
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then we were told that a five-year development plan is needed to be able to release the fund.

7715
06:04:03,210 --> 06:04:04,750
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I remember there was a director.

7716
06:04:04,930 --> 06:04:09,350
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We were at some point, maybe eight years ago, 10 years ago, na nagawa na rin niya to.

7717
06:04:09,490 --> 06:04:15,070
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So I just don't know kung natapos na yung five years na yon or never na-approve yung five years na yon.

7718
06:04:15,370 --> 06:04:16,370
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Hindi ko na masundan.

7719
06:04:16,830 --> 06:04:18,430
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero it's essential.

7720
06:04:18,650 --> 06:04:20,850
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Anyway, it's already with DBM, Secretary, so you know.

7721
06:04:21,170 --> 06:04:22,810
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because you need these people.

7722
06:04:22,810 --> 06:04:31,870
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because as we support the access to lower medicines, we're also concerned that there would be,

7723
06:04:32,210 --> 06:04:34,910
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: we, of course, would be concerned about the proliferation.

7724
06:04:34,930 --> 06:04:37,750
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Of fake medicines, substandard products.

7725
06:04:37,910 --> 06:04:41,490
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So we want to be sure that fully equipped ng FDA to deal with this.

7726
06:04:42,290 --> 06:04:42,450
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

7727
06:04:43,790 --> 06:04:45,990
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Mr. Chair, if I may respond a bit.

7728
06:04:46,650 --> 06:04:54,330
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: The outgoing DG endorsed to me, and I know there's a five-year plan, which includes the ISSP for their digitalization.

7729
06:04:54,790 --> 06:05:03,190
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And I think they got exemption from the DBM to hire 300 JOs, which I think are new positions that are now being filled up.

7730
06:05:04,930 --> 06:05:23,330
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, um, I'll wrap this up with a few more items and then, uh, Secretary, just talk to your staff and President Bev on other concerns so we can maximize your presence.

7731
06:05:23,330 --> 06:05:26,070
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You are needed outside of the halls of the Senate.

7732
06:05:26,670 --> 06:05:31,150
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Uh, I sponsored the Rheology Act.

7733
06:05:31,710 --> 06:05:33,770
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I opposed it in the beginning because it was my belief.

7734
06:05:33,770 --> 06:05:34,330
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I was not a big believer in the Rheology Act.

7735
06:05:34,330 --> 06:05:34,650
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I was not a big believer in the Rheology Act.

7736
06:05:34,650 --> 06:05:34,910
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I was not a big believer in the Rheology Act.

7737
06:05:34,910 --> 06:05:40,830
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I had a belief that before we start a new project, ayusin naman natin yung existing natin.

7738
06:05:40,910 --> 06:05:42,410
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Our existing is RITM.

7739
06:05:42,490 --> 06:05:43,770
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Where's the head of RITM?

7740
06:05:43,850 --> 06:05:46,190
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Si Director Duran?

7741
06:05:47,250 --> 06:05:47,850
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yeah.

7742
06:05:48,030 --> 06:06:03,910
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So your predecessor, uh, I committed without her even asking na hindi ko susuportan tong virology unless ipromise sakin ng lahat ng taong concerned na they will always provide sufficient financial support to RITM.

7743
06:06:04,400 --> 06:06:11,590
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I, I refuse to make it a relic of the past like, you know, the, the function is so important.

7744
06:06:11,590 --> 06:06:12,990
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So I'm so disappointed now.

7745
06:06:13,030 --> 06:06:15,310
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That has a decrease of 20 percent.

7746
06:06:15,470 --> 06:06:16,350
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do you know what it is?

7747
06:06:16,350 --> 06:06:18,310
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Cause I don't know what that decrease is.

7748
06:06:18,310 --> 06:06:19,910
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Would, would you know off the top of your…

