06:06:19,910 --> 06:06:22,580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Would, would you know off the top of your…

7750
06:06:22,580 --> 06:06:25,420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Mr. Chair let's recognize Director Duran.

7751
06:06:25,420 --> 06:06:29,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, Director Duran, please answer the query of Senator Gaitan.

7752
06:06:33,970 --> 06:06:36,830
RITM Director Atty. Ana Liza P. Hombrado-Duran: Good afternoon, Senator Pia.

